Lua-LSM is backported into ANCK through the Lua-LSM integration series
(ANBZ: #31935).

Enable CONFIG_SECURITY_LUA_LSM by default on architectures that currently
provide ARCH_HAS_SETJMP in this backport tree.
Keep loongarch, riscv, sw_64-6b, and sw_64-8a disabled until setjmp/longjmp
support is available there.
